// Northern Jazz Breaks — original ChickenChess arrangement inspired by Get a Move On!
// Samples are original synthesis. Serve /samples from this project when running this score.
// 16 white voices; 123 BPM; G Dorian; A4 / B8 / C4 / D8 bars.
// Manchester 1999 · Northern Jazz Breaks · Strudel
// Degrees follow the shared scale; each piece keeps its instrument.
setcps(123 / 60 / 4)
